# Allowlist ONLY these hosts. One host per line, matched as an FQDN
# (see tinyproxy.conf: FilterExtended On).
# train-tracker's own tailnet-only API is deliberately NOT here — it isn't
# reachable through this proxy at all (no route to the tailnet from this
# network); that call goes via the tailscale sidecar's own proxy instead.
# 1. Groq API -- STT/gates/composition/TTS.
^api\.groq\.com$
# 2. Langfuse Cloud -- matches the actual configured LANGFUSE_BASE_URL
# value, not assumed.
^cloud\.langfuse\.com$
